 =head1 PERFORMANCE
 
+On XPerl builds with C<PERL_RC_STACK>, dispatch uses the XS fallback.
+The custom opcode optimizations assume a stack without reference counting
+and are disabled on these builds. Method resolution and the C++ interface
+are unchanged, but the opcode optimization speedups do not apply.
